ciated with anti-gAChR antibodies. The distribution of the
target nAChRs in the CNS and peripheral autonomic nerves
explains the PERM-like symptoms and autonomic failure.
Thus, the clinical spectrum associated with anti-gAChR anti-
bodies is thus considered to extend from AAG to PERM.
